---
import { BOOKING_URL } from '../config/site.js';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="New Paving Sealing Melbourne | Seal New Stone | Spickle"
  description="Just had new stone or paving laid? Seal it before the first spill finds it. New installation sealing across Melbourne and the Mornington Peninsula, from $15/m²."
>
  <section class="band hairline-top">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>Just had new paving laid? Seal it now.</h1>
        <p class="lede">New stone has no protection the day it's laid, and the first barbecue is rarely far away.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href={BOOKING_URL}>Book a quote</a>
          <a class="tlink" href="tel:1300220045">Call 1300 22 00 45</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why">
        <p>Oil, red wine, leaves and barbecue fat soak straight into unsealed stone. Once a stain is inside, it's slow and costly to draw out, and some never fully come back.</p>
        <p>Sealed soon after installation, the stone starts life protected, and it keeps looking the way it did at handover.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band panel">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
          <h3>The stone cures</h3>
          <p>Stone and grout need to cure before sealing. Tell us when the job finished and we'll confirm the right window for your stone and sealer.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
          <h3>We clean off the build</h3>
          <p>Installation residue, grout haze and early efflorescence come off first, so the sealer bonds to stone, not film.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
          <h3>We seal</h3>
          <p>A penetrating sealer on most outdoor areas: natural look, slip resistance unchanged. Topical finishes where a sheen is wanted.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
          <h3>You get the care guide</h3>
          <p>How to look after it, and a realistic guide to when it'll need resealing. The job goes in our reseal diary, and we'll remind you when it's due.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap trade-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>Landscapers and builders</h2>
        <p>Sealing before handover finishes the job properly. Your client gets paving that's protected from day one, and the first-stain phone call never happens.</p>
        <p>We work in around your schedule, treat the stone you've laid with products matched to it, and leave the site ready to hand over.</p>
        <a class="tlink" href="tel:1300220045">Call to set up handover sealing</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="h-follow">Why trades use us</h2>
        <ul class="points">
          <li>The treatment is matched to the stone, so a cleaner that's safe on granite never touches your limestone</li>
          <li>One call per job: we quote from your plans or photos</li>
          <li>Your client gets care instructions under your handover, not a mystery surface</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band light">
    <div class="wrap price-row">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">What it costs</p>
        <p class="price"><span class="from">From</span> $15</p>
        <p class="per">per square metre, cleaning and sealing</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Your price depends on the sealer you choose and what the job needs. Rural jobs carry a separate travel fee, quoted up front.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-navy" href={BOOKING_URL}>Book a quote</a>
          <a class="tlink" href="/pricing">See pricing in detail</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(400px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .lede { font-size: var(--step-1); color: var(--lede); max-width: 30ch; }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.9rem 1.6rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  .why { max-width: 540px; }
  .steps { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(230px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); }
  .steps li { padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--teal); }
  .step-n { font-family: var(--display); font-size-adjust: var(--display-adjust); font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--accent); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .steps h3 { font-family: var(--font); font-size-adjust: var(--font-adjust); font-size: var(--step-0); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.35em; }
  .steps p { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; }
  .trade-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: start; }
  .h-follow { font-size: var(--step-1); }
  .points { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; max-width: var(--measure); }
  .points li { padding: 0.7rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); color: var(--muted); }
  .points li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .price-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(360px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem); align-items: center; }
  .price .from { display: block; font-family: var(--font); font-size-adjust: var(--font-adjust); font-size: var(--step-1); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--teal-deep); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .kicker { font-size: var(--step-0); font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-deep); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .price { font-family: var(--display); font-size-adjust: var(--display-adjust); font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 7vw, 6.5rem); line-height: 0.95; color: var(--navy); margin: 0; }
  .per { font-size: var(--step-0); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .trade-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
